      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - npcText: "I am... Huh, wait... I never bothered giving myself a name around here,
      don\u2019t even need it.\nI guess you can find me on LinkedIn."
    answers:
    - text: Oh, ok...
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - npcText: "You shouldn\u2019t stuff your nose in other people\u2019s business.\LI
      have some appointment, obviously."
    answers:
    - text: Oh, ok...
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - npcText: "How long? How could I possibly know... Didn\u2019t you notice the clock
